<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile cancels Oct 9 ferrochromium sale.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile cancels Oct 9 ferrochromium sale.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said Thursday it cancelled an announced sale of surplus ferrochromium that was set for Oct 9.</p>
<p>The next sale is expected to be held in the first quarter of 1997, the agency said.</p>
<p>The date will be announced later, it said.</p>
<p>--Washington Commodities Desk 202-898-8489</p>
</text>
